 o=r['native_operation'];comment.append('| '+o['operation_id']+' | '+o['kind']+' | `'+o['after_capture']['sha256']+'` |')
comment += ['', 'The ten operations cover13distinct original case tuples:7creates and3promotions. The complete prospective3,550-owner inventory has zero incoming ingredient/component references to their identifiers. The actual promotion preimages and untouched counterparts are pinned in TEN-OPERATION-DISPOSITION-JOINS.json. This is not an equivalence/merge decision or a new reagent assignment.', '', 'HCl retains its explicit common-scope/comparable-evidence co-install condition; Swine retains its raw-label source-routing condition before promotion; BD211065, Difco nutrient and Wilkins retain named competing-owner/continuity prerequisites; Ward/generic Cerophyll retain unresolved named continuity. Existing source-qualified assertions remain evidence, not installation authority. Three W03 cases refer to #1196 (BD211065 also#1182/#1165); HCl/Swine retain#1237 and#1201 context. Cerophyll originals cite#1226/#1201, which alone do not constitute resolution of their product-continuity condition.', '', 'Previously filed#758 coupled phosphorus work and the three earlier#1237stock deferrals remain separate. The cancelled partial root must not resume; this comment makes no assertion that all its phosphate edits were absent. The transparently corrected status receipt controls that historical fact. Future source selection must use a fresh exact plan and preserve all original cases/origins; no automatic count-forcing or source modification is authorized by this audit.', '', 'The two PPLO catalog owners and ordinary role/export/quantity/version holds are not newly deferred by this finding. Existing affirmative nominal-family and Columbia coupled reconciliations remain intact.']
with (D/'issue-comment-draft.md').open('x') as f:f.write('\n'.join(comment)+'\n')
manifest=[{'path':str(p.relative_to(D)),'sha256':sha(p.read_bytes()),'bytes':p.stat().st_size} for p in sorted(D.rglob('*')) if p.is_file() and p.name not in ['HANDOFF.json','MANIFEST.json','seal.stdout','seal.stderr']]
